# Acquire the client's pose from imagery, with no prior.
#
# Restarts are drawn uniformly over SO(3) and the lowest final loss wins.
# Measured in phase 4: 22 percent of single attempts land in the true basin,
# and best of 8 reaches 87 percent. This takes about 106 s at 8 restarts on
# CPU, which is why it is an action and not a service.
int32 restarts
int32 iterations
bool inject_flip            # test hook: return the 180 degree flip of whatever was found
---
bool acquired
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped pose
float64 final_loss
int32 restarts_used
string reason
---
int32 restarts_done
float64 best_loss
